issue_context.body:
Typescript enums should be transpiled such that they can be removed by minifiers if not used.

So 
```ts
enum Test {
    Key = 1
}
```
currently becomes
```js
var Test;
(function(Test) {
    Test[Test["Key"] = 1] = "Key";
})(Test || (Test = {}));
```
but should be 
```js
var Test = /* @__PURE__ */ ((x) => {
  x[x["Key"] = 1] = "Key";
  return x;
})(Test || {});
```

### Context

Related issues: 
Babel: https://github.com/babel/babel/issues/9268
TSC: https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/27604
Terser: https://github.com/terser/terser/issues/1177
Esbuild does this already: https://github.com/terser/terser/issues/1177#issuecomment-1104625572
